  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Clone_Wars_Campaign_Guide\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide\">Star Wars Saga Edition Clone Wars Campaign Guide</a></i> </p><p>The Wrist Rocket Launcher is a versatile personal Weapon designed to be useful in various combat situations. It mounts on the forearm and extends over the back of the wielder's hand. Bounty hunters favor the Weapon, despite various government attempts to ban the Weapons and force production to stop. </p><p>Wrist Rocket Launchers are Single-Shot Weapons that must be reloaded after each shot. They fire only <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Wrist_Rocket_Ammunition\" title=\"Wrist Rocket Ammunition\">Wrist Rocket Ammunition</a>, and are considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Pistols\" title=\"Pistols\">Pistols</a> for the purposes of determining <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;This is an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Area_Attack\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Area Attack\">Area Attack</a>&nbsp;Weapon. </p>",
